blocks.en:
Figure 4: In-fusion vision capacity adds to the shared backbone instead of replacing it. (a) All text and vision tokens are processed by shared modules ( gray );
vision tokens also pass through vision-only modules ( blue with pink outline) that add to the shared outputs;
in-fusion (FFN-only) omits the vision attention projections ( Δ \Delta QKV, Δ \Delta O). (b) MoT uses entirely separate modules for text and vision, so the modality streams interact only through attention.

blocks.zh:
图4:注入式愿景能力增加了共享骨干而非取而代之. (a) 所有文字和视觉符号均由共享模块(灰色)处理;
视觉符号还经过仅能显示视觉的模块(蓝色和粉红色的大纲),增加共享产出;
内聚(FFN-只)省略了视觉注意力预测(QQ\Delta QKV,QQ\Delta O). (b) MOT对文本和视觉使用完全独立的模块,因此模式流只能通过关注来互动.
